=Research this defensive security request.

REQUEST TYPE: {{ $json.request_type }}
TARGET SYSTEM / TECHNOLOGY: {{ $json.target }}
DETAILS: {{ $json.details }}

Gather current CVE data, vendor advisories, and threat-intel context relevant to this request.

=REQUEST TYPE: {{ $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json.request_type }}
TARGET: {{ $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json.target }}

RESEARCH FINDINGS:
{{ $json.output }}

Produce defensive guidance appropriate to the request type:
- CVE Lookup & Impact Summary → impact/severity assessment plus concrete patch/mitigation steps
- Hardening Checklist → a prioritized, checkbox-style hardening checklist
- Threat Intel Briefing → "what this means for defenders" analysis and monitoring/detection recommendations
- Incident Report Drafting → a structured incident-response checklist and containment/remediation guidance
- Security Advisory Summary → a plain-language summary of the advisory with recommended actions

=Compile a professional security report.

REQUEST TYPE: {{ $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json.request_type }}
TARGET: {{ $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json.target }}
REQUESTED BY: {{ $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json.requester }}

HARDENING / REMEDIATION GUIDANCE:
{{ $json.output }}

RESEARCH FINDINGS:
{{ $('🔍 Threat Intel Analyst Agent').first().json.output }}

Structure the report as: Executive Summary, Findings, Risk Rating, Recommended Actions (from the guidance above), and note any limitations of this automated research.

parameters.jsCode:
const cfg = $('⚙️ Prepare Context').first().json;
const research = $('🔍 Threat Intel Analyst Agent').first().json.output || '';
const report = $input.first().json.output || '';

let sources = '_No structured sources returned \u2014 verify claims manually._';
const split = research.split(/###\s*SOURCES/i);
if (split.length > 1) sources = split[1].trim();

const finalMarkdown = `# Security Report: ${cfg.target}\n\n*Type: ${cfg.request_type} \u00b7 Generated: ${cfg.timestamp} \u00b7 Requested by: ${cfg.requester}*\n*Authorization confirmed: ${cfg.authorization}*\n\n---\n\n${report}\n\n---\n\n## Sources\n\n${sources}\n\n---\n\n> **Disclaimer:** This report was generated by an automated defensive-research assistant for the stated, confirmed-authorized target only. It does not constitute a penetration test, a guarantee of security, or legal advice. It contains no exploit code and no intrusion instructions. Verify all findings independently before acting on them.\n`;

return [{
  json: {
    blocked: false,
    target: cfg.target,
    request_type: cfg.request_type,
    generated_date: cfg.timestamp,
    final_markdown: finalMarkdown
  }
}];
